{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Warden Sandigill. The park is under his protection.\"\n*\"I see. He showed us mercy, let all my soldiers leave freely. I accepted his terms immediately. By the gods, I just wanted to protect my home. If I had known what was happening in Hampstead.\"*","created_at":"2021-08-26T20:42:28.326000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880552803884490807","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'I see. I too can understand wanting to protect one's home.' she nods, and holds out a hand.","created_at":"2021-08-26T20:44:12.165000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880553239416827934","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Tom's halfway through extending his hand, hesitates for a moment looking downwards, before taking a deep breath and shaking Sabrine's hand.","created_at":"2021-08-26T20:45:16.537000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880553509412560937","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(yeah I was thinking he might be concerned because of poison, don't worry)\nshe smiles. 'Well, Tom - you'll be seeing a lot of us, of course. I hope together we can make this city a better place.'","created_at":"2021-08-26T20:46:42.841000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880553871397752983","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
