{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Roy nods. \"Welcome to Murry Hill. I hope you'll be able to feel at home here.\"\n\"*Thank you. Is there anything I can do now?*\"\n\"Well, in all honesty, you just took part in a battle. Take your time to learn your way around the area. Can't care for a place you don't know.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T20:51:39.247000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880555114614636604","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she nods. 'We need to rest for now, but my Guide, Kukudh, will answer any questions you may have. You might have seen them flitting around earlier, but,'\nshe utters a sound in Grung, and in a puff of smoke, an imp appears, who makes a dramatic bow. `Heya.`","created_at":"2021-08-26T20:53:28.127000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880555571290472448","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"You'll find us mostly around nighttime, if you're up by then. If you don't mind, we're overdue for a rest too. Be seeing you around.\"\nRoy gets the blankets off the tree and places them for himself and Sab.\n\"*May I ask one more question?*\"\n\"Sure.\"\n\"*What's with the cottage? I was told I can't go there, and you're setting up for sleep outside.*\"\n\"Oh, that. Don't worry about it. Long story.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T20:56:28.740000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880556328836272128","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Being outside is more comfortable anyway, at least to me. If you'd like a hammock, Kukudh can get you one of our old ones, though.'","created_at":"2021-08-26T20:57:15.791000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880556526182494289","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Ed, see ya later. I hope you'll still be up by the time more guests show up. I think it might be useful for you.\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T20:57:57.122000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880556699537252453","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Ed doesn't even lift their eyes from the writing, then after a beat \"Pie for later, right?\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T20:59:59.558000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880557213071081482","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
